  "quotes": [
    {
      "block": "原句1",
      "no": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "In Willow Creek, September 1st might as well have been a holiday",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 47
        },
        {
          "text": "Halloween. And yes, I said season",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 283
        },
        {
          "text": "In Willow Creek, Halloween didn’t last one night. It started on September 1st and didn’t end until November 1st",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 318
        },
        {
          "text": "By sunrise, hay bales lined the sidewalks, pumpkins crowded every storefront, and orange lights twinkled from every lamp",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 429
        }
      ],
      "words": 58
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "September 1st had been my favorite day of the year for as long as I could remember. It marked the end of a brutal Georgi",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 909
        },
        {
          "text": "I loved carving pumpkins with Pops and Meme and helping host the annual Willow Creek Harvest Festival every October. But",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1079
        }
      ],
      "words": 80
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Pops had gotten me into barrel racing when I was young. He used to say I was a natural-born racer after watching me ride",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1330
        },
        {
          "text": "As I got older, the wins started piling up. Every ribbon, buckle, and trophy made Pops and Meme prouder than the last",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1671
        },
        {
          "text": "Blueberry had been Pops’s gift to me after I won my first youth championship",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1876
        }
      ],
      "words": 72
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I read the email three times before I finally believed it. Then a fourth. And a fifth. Just to be extra sure I wasn’t mi",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2251
        },
        {
          "text": "My heart hammered wildly against my ribs. This is what I had been waiting for all these years. A sponsorship",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2474
        },
        {
          "text": "Not a discount code. Not free gear. Not a local feed store wanting a picture for Facebook. An actual sponsorship with re",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2604
        }
      ],
      "words": 71
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“What’s got you grinnin’ like a fool?” he asked, raising a graying brow. “Finally find a boy willing to put up with you?",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4474
        },
        {
          "text": "Not that I minded. Boys came and went. Barrel racing didn’t",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4837
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yep. Soon as I win my way through the circuit and go pro, I’m buying you the nicest truck in Georgia.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5676
        },
        {
          "text": "“The whole state.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5831
        }
      ],
      "words": 61
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Meme hugged me twice before I climbed into the driver’s seat of the red Ford F-150 Pops bought for me when I turned sixt",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6414
        },
        {
          "text": "“Don’t forget where home is, Sunshine.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6772
        },
        {
          "text": "My chest tightened at the silly nickname, one that I had found embarrassing at one point in my life, but now loved. “You",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6809
        }
      ],
      "words": 59
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "My phone buzzed in the cupholder, Meme’s face flashing on my iPhone. I smiled immediately",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8848
        },
        {
          "text": "I reached for the phone. Then paused. She’d kill me if she knew I answered while driving in the rain",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9155
        }
      ],
      "words": 36
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Then the driver overcorrected. The truck fishtailed. The headlights swung sideways. Straight toward me",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10262
        },
        {
          "text": "The truck filled my windshield. The glass shattered, slicing my skin as metal crunched around me, the noise so deafening",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10661
        },
        {
          "text": "Please let Blueberry be okay",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10943
        },
        {
          "text": "The impact snapped my head back, and darkness swallowed everything before I could so much as twitch",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 11191
        }
      ],
      "words": 65
    }
